Package: ChIPBindVis
Type: Package
Title: ChIP-seq Binding Visualization at Target Gene Promoters
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Changhao",
                  family = "Kan",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "kanchanghao@example.com")
Description: One-command, publication-ready ChIP-seq binding visualization
    at target gene promoters. Given a bigWig signal file and a narrowPeak file,
    produces a Gviz genome browser track at a single gene promoter and an
    EnrichedHeatmap across all target gene TSSs, using a built-in Morandi
    color palette. Targets human (hg38) ENCODE-style data.
